    "notes": "Refines soldier, cavalry and artillery meshes while retaining original animations. Adds bone-bound faces, uniform trim, horse tack/hooves, wood cannon carriages, detailed capital architecture, terrain relief shading and dark-water detail. Adds Android thermal protection, adaptive board resolution, distant idle rig sleeping and refreshed menu portrait/icon controls. Fixes repeated camera refocus after manual input, playing-card details, live local dice finishes, and card notice/feed overlap. Retains existing rules and geography.",
